{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"text\": \"难堪没让他少喜欢，可再多给一点，也证明不了自己什么都不求。\",\n      \"key\": \"证明不了\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍盼被珍惜，却不再反复看对方在不在意，也不逼自己什么都不求，就按眼下的心意关心对方，也盼对方过得好。\",\n      \"key\": \"眼下的心意\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"text\": \"关心对方时，他觉得这份喜欢留在心里也很甜，暂时忘了自己为何盼回应，可那念头过会儿又回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"留在心里也很甜\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"text\": \"心思静下来后，他仍得自己承受想被珍惜的心事，亲近再深也不能替他感受，甜意里便有些酸楚。\",\n      \"key\": \"自己承受\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R24\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留难堪没有消掉喜欢、继续加码也证明不了无所求的意思，把抽象的矛盾总结改成具体发现。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R25\", \"R26\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他仍有期待、却不再反复检查或强迫自己毫无所求的中间立场，并把注意力转回眼前真实愿意做的关心。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R27\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留独自珍藏喜欢的甜意，并写明回应的念头只是暂时退开、过后仍会回来，为后段喜欢加深留下原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"去掉与 S05-4 重复的害怕亲近留不住，改由独处时想被珍惜的心事仍只能自己承受，解释美好亲近中的孤单与酸楚，补足 B3。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5ad99626-25a9-4033-9ca0-70d1238a7422", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T224611218519Z", "elapsed_seconds": 105.968, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T22:47:57.204548+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cd7df88b2dd16efbb3c2b0cb69f7c7f57b6459800b17b736b90f2c7986a0e271", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T224611218519Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "c9060518a65117cb9d6f9ebae34f6c648474ca9fb90ea14e3c92ffc59e148f08"}}}
